{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000011517","bookName":"Destinada a mi alfa despiadado","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000011517/42000011517.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":5787685,"followCount":131899,"introduction":"Siete años después de una noche en la que fue drogada, la criada Elena perdió a su loba y quedó embarazada. Al recuperarla, descubre que su pareja destinada es su cruel opresor, el Alfa Mateo. Él la rechaza y la entrega al temido Alfa Hugo. Pero Elena pronto descubre la verdad: Hugo no es un monstruo, sino su segunda pareja destinada y el verdadero padre biológico de su hijo Lucas—una redención perfecta regalada por la Diosa de la Luna.","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Werewolf","Hidden Identity"],"tags":["Werewolf","Hidden Identity"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Destinada-a-mi-alfa-despiadado","bookNameLower":"destinada-a-mi-alfa-despiadado","shelfTime":"2026-05-10 11:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-05-10 11:00:00","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700741274","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/47/7x1/71x5/715x1/71511000024/700741274_1/700741274.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=oUMafXXg0PmNJw1Wi8mvN6ByityDPLgTql7KcfW8d0xAaV824gmuelQteIQgJT2DFVMAlMXi~OLljRor4PfxJUR2tAWQe2xDlR56f2Ati4Yo99U-X1wKIq7i8kWMk2q81z~OT22YZFICuruiaqE4MVTWAOiVCST3nlgVYtgKgd1eEZuFn5vMG22mxq~YGe~NNWxCeuqgUW6ZDDoqokqPiLaEyA-wyZc-fwG-vmLh7cEJIROe1yn-Pmk3zjgnJuKz9WMNAEp7Rsm6H65LxnPw5SJKzksCtTu9dVKK0bvHLvSJCs2d~yucPJ-12HQxbK5EubttKjo--m9lGaEr7UVK5A__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/47/7x1/71x5/715x1/71511000024/700741274_1/700741274.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":110857,"price":0},{"id":"700741275","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/57/7x1/71x5/715x1/71511000024/70